graph LR
  Onb["Onboarding<br/>wake, bed, busy hours"]
  Call["Call outcome<br/>picked up / missed<br/>weight 1"]
  Tap["Widget taps<br/>Book = free, Busy<br/>weight 2"]
  Cal["Calendar<br/>meeting times only"]

  Prior["1. Prior<br/>green 75%, yellow 50%, red 12.5%<br/>worth 2 calls"]
  Learn["2. Bayesian learner<br/>Beta(a, b) per person<br/>per half-hour, weekday + weekend<br/>old evidence halves every 28 days"]
  Odds["3. Pick-up odds<br/>p = a / (a + b)<br/>green 65%+, red under 35%"]
  Block["4. Calendar override<br/>in a meeting = won't pick up"]
  Sched["5. Scheduler<br/>tries every 30-min start, next 24 h<br/>score = sum of log p, minus fairness<br/>skips if anyone under 20%"]
  Best["6. Best time to call<br/>app + widget + Live Activity"]
  Claude["7. Claude Haiku<br/>one sentence why<br/>template if slow or no key"]
  Ledger["Fairness ledger<br/>minutes each person spent<br/>on awkward hours"]

  Onb --> Prior
  Prior --> Learn
  Call -->|1 or 0| Learn
  Tap -->|1 or 0, counts double| Learn
  Cal -->|past meetings = busy| Learn
  Learn --> Odds
  Odds --> Block
  Cal -->|upcoming meetings| Block
  Block --> Sched
  Ledger -->|who already took a bad hour| Sched
  Sched --> Best
  Sched -->|names, local times, pick-up %| Claude
  Claude --> Best
  Best -->|both tap Book| Ledger
  Best -.->|the call happens, outcome feeds back| Call
